    Bug 1950629 - Whe parsing an address, use last bracketed email as email. r=tobyp

    Uses the last *bracketed* email address, adding any previous bracketed email to the display name.
    Junk after the last bracketed email is still ignored.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D245917

